{"id":"2c9b9e13382b3ed9","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-henkin-maxcon.md","title":"Henkin Maximally Consistent","display":"thm-henkin-maxcon — Henkin Maximally Consistent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-henkin-maxcon","aliases":["57-thm-henkin-maxcon"],"display":"thm-henkin-maxcon — Henkin Maximally Consistent","depends_on":["[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-consistency]]","[[57-df-henkin-witness]]","[[57-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-henkin-maxcon"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-henkin-maxcon</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-henkin-maxcon — Henkin Maximally Consistent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" href=\"?note=c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" title=\"57-df-consistency\">57-df-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8a3ea6c384666db\" href=\"?note=e8a3ea6c384666db\" title=\"57-df-henkin-witness\">57-df-henkin-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\max(|S|,\\aleph_0)\">\\(\\kappa=\\max(|S|,\\aleph_0)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不交、基数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的新常量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&#39;=S\\cup C\">\\(S&#39;=S\\cup C\\)</span>；常量分区扩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup C\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup C\\)</span>，其余分区不变。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> 在原语言评价，结论的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxCon}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxCon}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Henkin}\">\\(\\mathrm{Henkin}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&#39;\">\\(S&#39;\\)</span> 评价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi)\\to\\exists\\Phi^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S&#39;}\\;\n(\\Phi\\subseteq\\Phi^*\\land\\mathrm{MaxCon}(\\Phi^*)\\land\\mathrm{Henkin}(\\Phi^*)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}(\\Phi)\\to\\exists\\Phi^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S&#39;}\\;\n(\\Phi\\subseteq\\Phi^*\\land\\mathrm{MaxCon}(\\Phi^*)\\land\\mathrm{Henkin}(\\Phi^*)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不能无条件在原语言中得到 Henkin 极大一致扩张；例如原语言可能没有任何常量。此处显式列出需要的语言扩张而不改动原句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"c3d5023e5f50e6a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-henkin-witness","status":"resolved","